WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:20.000
A large Tunisian musical ensemble performs Malouf on the stage of the Municipal Theatre of Tunis.

00:20.000 --> 00:45.000
The performance brings together strings, percussion, singers and a conductor beneath red stage curtains.

00:45.000 --> 01:10.000
The ensemble continues the instrumental and vocal performance before a seated audience.

01:10.000 --> 01:31.400
The camera holds a wide view of La Rachidia ensemble performing on stage. Music continues.
